@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container py-4">

    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-9">

            <div class="card shadow-sm border-0">
                <div class="card-body p-4 p-md-5">

                    <h1 class="mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>

                    <p class="text-muted mb-4">
                        This page explains how customer and vehicle information
                        is handled within the Detailing Studio management system.
                    </p>

                    <hr />

                    <h4 class="mt-4">Customer Information</h4>

                    <p>
                        The application may store customer information such as
                        first name, last name, phone number and email address.
                        This information is used only for managing detailing
                        appointments, vehicles and customer orders.
                    </p>


                    <h4 class="mt-4">Vehicle Information</h4>

                    <p>
                        Vehicle information such as make, model, registration
                        number, VIN, year, color and vehicle category may be
                        stored in order to provide and manage detailing services.
                    </p>


                    <h4 class="mt-4">Order Information</h4>

                    <p>
                        The system stores information related to detailing
                        orders, including selected services, appointment dates,
                        prices, order status and optional notes.
                    </p>


                    <h4 class="mt-4">Financial Information</h4>

                    <p>
                        Expense information may be stored for internal business
                        tracking and dashboard statistics. The application does
                        not process payment card information.
                    </p>


                    <h4 class="mt-4">Data Usage</h4>

                    <p>
                        Stored information is used only for the operation of the
                        Detailing Studio management system and for generating
                        internal statistics such as revenue, expenses and
                        completed services.
                    </p>


                    <h4 class="mt-4">Data Security</h4>

                    <p>
                        Access to the system should be limited to authorized
                        users. Sensitive configuration data such as database
                        credentials should not be stored in the public source
                        code repository.
                    </p>


                    <h4 class="mt-4">Data Removal</h4>

                    <p>
                        Customer, vehicle and business information can be
                        updated or removed through the available management
                        functionality, subject to relationships with existing
                        orders and historical records.
                    </p>


                    <hr class="mt-4" />

                    <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                        This application is developed as an educational project
                        for managing the operations of a detailing studio.
                    </p>

                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

</div>